    {"brand":"Samsung","match":"^Galaxy (S2[1-3](\\+| Ultra| FE)?|S21 FE 5G|Z (Fold|Flip)[3-5]|Tab S[89](\\+| Ultra)?)$","os_years":4,"os_upgrades":4,"security_years":5,"from":"launch","official":true,"note":"Feb 2022 policy: four generations of One UI/Android upgrades + five years of security updates for S21/S22 and 'upcoming S series' (S23 incl. FE), Z Fold3/Flip3 and 'upcoming Z series' (Fold4/5, Flip4/5), Tab S8 and 'upcoming Tab S series' (Tab S9 assumed covered; later Tab S models not verified)","source":"https://news.samsung.com/global/samsung-sets-the-new-standard-with-four-generations-of-os-upgrades-to-ensure-the-most-up-to-date-and-more-secure-galaxy-experience"},
